  <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: 4 October 2026</em></p>
  <p>These terms are an agreement between you and Automonie. By creating an account or using the app, you agree to them. Please read them, particularly the section on what Automonie is not.</p>

  <h2>1. The service</h2>
  <p>Automonie is a personal finance management tool. It helps you record and categorise transactions, set budgets and savings goals, get reminders for bills and subscriptions, and view insights about your money. Automonie does not hold or move your money. It is available on the web and on Android.</p>

  <h2>2. Your account</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You must be at least 18 years old and provide accurate registration details.</li>
    <li>You are responsible for keeping your password, PIN and device secure, and for activity that happens under your account.</li>
    <li>Enable two-step verification and app lock where available.</li>
    <li>Tell us immediately at <a href="mailto:tobe@automonie.com">tobe@automonie.com</a> if you suspect unauthorised access.</li>
    <li>One person, one account. Don't share your account with others.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. What Automonie is not</h2>
  <p>This section matters, so we've kept it plain:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Automonie is not a bank and does not take deposits in its own right.</li>
    <li>We do not provide financial, investment, tax or legal advice. Insights, scores, forecasts and suggestions in the app are informational only, generated from the data available to us. They are not a recommendation to take any particular financial action. Decisions about your money are yours.</li>
    <li>Bank linking and subscription payments are provided by licensed third-party partners, and are subject to those partners' own terms.</li>
    <li>Automated categorisation and imported data can contain errors, always check anything important against your bank's own records, which take precedence.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Linked bank accounts</h2>
  <p>Linking a bank account is optional. If you link one, you authorise us and our open-banking provider to retrieve transaction and account information on your behalf, on a read-only basis. We cannot move money from a linked account. You may disconnect at any time from the app, which stops further retrieval immediately.</p>

  <h2>5. Bank alerts and automatic capture</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You can forward bank alert emails, turn on notification capture on Android, set up an iPhone Shortcut, or share receipts, so transactions are logged for you. Each is optional and can be turned off at any time.</li>
    <li>Your capture key lets your phone add transactions to your account. Keep it private; you can replace it from the app, which disconnects anything using the old one.</li>
    <li>Captured transactions are read automatically and can be wrong. Check anything important, and correct it in the app.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Savings goals</h2>
  <p>Savings goals record money you set aside yourself. Adding to or taking from a goal in Automonie only updates its progress; no money is moved, held or invested.</p>

  <h2>7. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Don't: attempt to break, probe or overload the service; access another user's account; scrape or reverse-engineer the app; upload malicious files; or use the service to break the law.</p>

  <h2>8. Availability</h2>
  <p>We work to keep Automonie available and accurate, but we provide it "as is". We do not promise uninterrupted or error-free service. We may change, suspend or discontinue features, and will give reasonable notice of significant changes where we can.</p>

  <h2>9. Fees</h2>
  <p>Core features are free. Automonie Pro is an optional paid plan; its price and what it includes are shown clearly in the app before you pay, and you will not be charged without your agreement. You can turn off auto-renewal at any time, and you keep Pro until the end of the period you paid for.</p>

  <h2>10. Your content</h2>
  <p>Your financial data remains yours. You grant us only the permission needed to operate the service for you, to store, process and display your data back to you. We do not sell it. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>11. Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>The Automonie name, logo, software and design are owned by us. These terms don't transfer any of that to you.</p>

  <h2>12. Ending your account</h2>
  <p>You can delete your account at any time from the app. We may suspend or terminate an account that breaches these terms, is used unlawfully, or poses a risk to other users or to us.</p>

  <h2>13. Liability</h2>
  <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Automonie is not liable for indirect or consequential loss, or for loss arising from decisions you take based on information in the app, from errors in imported or categorised data, or from failures of third-party banking or payment partners. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p>

